Readout: HYP-2598 is the (2,3) row.  The next exact sieve rows are (2,3,5) -> mod 30 and (2,3,5,7) -> mod 210.  The latter is not a standalone proof, but it is the natural address lattice for combining parity/triadic centers with the seven-sector support-six tail.

